        }
      }
    },
    "Anthropic 按商业服务条款处理：默认不用来训练模型，一般在 30 天内删除。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Anthropic handles it under its commercial terms: by default it isn't used to train models, and it's usually deleted within 30 days."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Anthropic 按商业服务条款处理：默认不用来训练模型，一般在 30 天内删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 给出的热量和营养目标是根据公式估算的参考值，不是医疗建议。本 App 适用于 18 岁以上的成年人。如有疾病（尤其是肾病、糖尿病）、处于孕期或哺乳期，或有饮食失调史，请先咨询医生或注册营养师。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The calorie and nutrition targets are formula-based estimates, not medical advice. This app is for adults 18 and older. If you have a health condition (especially kidney disease or diabetes), are pregnant or breastfeeding, or have a history of eating disorders, please talk to a doctor or registered dietitian first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App 给出的热量和营养目标是根据公式估算的参考值，不是医疗建议。本 App 适用于 18 岁以上的成年人。如有疾病（尤其是肾病、糖尿病）、处于孕期或哺乳期，或有饮食失调史，请先咨询医生或注册营养师。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BMI 低于 %lld 时，公式算出的目标不一定适合你，建议请医生或注册营养师帮你确定每天吃多少。在那之前，可以把每日目标当作每天至少要吃到的量。如果吃饭或体重让你感到有压力，也可以找心理咨询师聊聊。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With a BMI below %lld, formula-based targets may not suit you. Please ask a doctor or registered dietitian to help decide how much to eat each day. Until then, you can treat your daily target as the minimum to eat each day. If eating or your weight feels stressful, talking with a counselor can also help."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BMI 低于 %lld 时，公式算出的目标不一定适合你，建议请医生或注册营养师帮你确定每天吃多少。在那之前，可以把每日目标当作每天至少要吃到的量。如果吃饭或体重让你感到有压力，也可以找心理咨询师聊聊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
