          }
        }
      }
    },
    "体重 %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "weight %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "体重 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "体重偏轻时，公式估算的消耗可能偏低。如果两周的平均体重还在下降，每天多吃 200～300 千卡，或咨询医生、营养师。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you're underweight, the formula may underestimate your energy needs. If your two-week average weight keeps dropping, eat 200–300 kcal more a day, or talk to a doctor or dietitian."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "体重偏轻时，公式估算的消耗可能偏低。如果两周的平均体重还在下降，每天多吃 200～300 千卡，或咨询医生、营养师。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "体重基数较大时，配合力量训练、按维持热量吃也能长肌肉，同时不额外增加体脂。可以考虑选择「维持」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At a higher body weight, you can build muscle while eating at maintenance with strength training, without adding extra fat. Consider choosing Maintain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "体重基数较大时，配合力量训练、按维持热量吃也能长肌肉，同时不额外增加体脂。可以考虑选择「维持」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "体重需要在 %lld～%lld 公斤之间" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Weight must be between %1$lld and %2$lld kg"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "体重需要在 %lld～%lld 公斤之间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "体重需要在 %lld～%lld 磅之间" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Weight must be between %1$lld and %2$lld lb"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "体重需要在 %lld～%lld 磅之间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的 BMI 约为 %@，低于 %@，属于偏轻范围，所以这里不提供减脂目标。可以选择「维持」或「增肌」；如果对体重有顾虑，建议咨询医生或营养师。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your BMI is about %1$@, below %2$@, which is in the underweight range, so a fat-loss target isn't offered. You can choose Maintain or Build Muscle. If you have concerns about your weight, consider talking to a doctor or dietitian."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 BMI 约为 %@，低于 %@，属于偏轻范围，所以这里不提供减脂目标。可以选择「维持」或「增肌」；如果对体重有顾虑，建议咨询医生或营养师。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的每日目标" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Daily Targets"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的每日目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的目标" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Goal"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的目标是减脂：每天比总消耗少吃 %@，但最多少 %@ 千卡。这个上限按你的体重算：让体重每周下降不超过约 %@，并且不超过 %@ 千卡。缺口不大，体重下降比较平稳，也更容易保住肌肉：" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your goal is to lose fat: eat %1$@ less than your total energy use, but no more than %2$@ kcal less. That cap is based on your weight, so you lose no more than about %3$@ of your body weight a week, and it's never more than %4$@ kcal. A modest gap keeps weight loss steady and makes it easier to keep muscle:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的目标是减脂：每天比总消耗少吃 %@，但最多少 %@ 千卡。这个上限按你的体重算：让体重每周下降不超过约 %@，并且不超过 %@ 千卡。缺口不大，体重下降比较平稳，也更容易保住肌肉："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的目标是增肌：每天比总消耗多吃 %@，但最多多 %@ 千卡，给肌肉生长提供原料，同时不会长太多脂肪" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your goal is to build muscle: eat %1$@ more than your total energy use, up to %2$@ kcal more, to fuel muscle growth without gaining too much fat"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的目标是增肌：每天比总消耗多吃 %@，但最多多 %@ 千卡，给肌肉生长提供原料，同时不会长太多脂肪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的目标是维持：吃进去的和消耗的差不多就好：" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your goal is to maintain: aim to eat about as much as you use:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的目标是维持：吃进去的和消耗的差不多就好："
          }
        }
      }
    },
