    "先发到本 App 的服务器，再由服务器转交给 Anthropic。结果只发回你的手机。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It goes to this app's server, which passes it on to Anthropic. Results are sent back only to your phone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先发到本 App 的服务器，再由服务器转交给 Anthropic。结果只发回你的手机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先填重量、再填热量，之后改重量才会按比例换算。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter the weight before the calories, and later weight changes will scale the other values. "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先填重量、再填热量，之后改重量才会按比例换算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先花 1 分钟填写基本资料，App 会算出适合你的每日热量和三大营养素目标。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Take a minute to enter some basic info, and the app will work out daily calorie, protein, carb and fat targets that fit you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先花 1 分钟填写基本资料，App 会算出适合你的每日热量和三大营养素目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
