    "拍照识别、生成食谱和推荐下一餐，是由 Anthropic 公司的 Claude AI 完成的。第一次使用前，请先看看会发送哪些内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Photo scanning, recipe generation and next-meal suggestions are powered by Claude, an AI from Anthropic. Before you use them for the first time, here's what gets sent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拍照识别、生成食谱和推荐下一餐，是由 Anthropic 公司的 Claude AI 完成的。第一次使用前，请先看看会发送哪些内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拍照识别：你选的这张餐食照片。上传前会缩小并重新压缩，不带拍摄地点等信息。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Photo scan: the meal photo you choose. It's resized and re-compressed before upload, without the location or other photo details."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拍照识别：你选的这张餐食照片。上传前会缩小并重新压缩，不带拍摄地点等信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按三大营养素算约 %@ 千卡，和填写的热量差得比较多，可以再核对一下。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
