    "热量和营养目标是根据公式估算的参考值，不是医疗建议。如有疾病（尤其是肾病、糖尿病）、处于孕期或哺乳期，或有饮食失调史，请先咨询医生或注册营养师。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Calorie and nutrition targets are formula-based estimates, not medical advice. If you have a health condition (especially kidney disease or diabetes), are pregnant or breastfeeding, or have a history of eating disorders, please talk to a doctor or registered dietitian first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "热量和营养目标是根据公式估算的参考值，不是医疗建议。如有疾病（尤其是肾病、糖尿病）、处于孕期或哺乳期，或有饮食失调史，请先咨询医生或注册营养师。"
